{"id":7116,"date":"2020-05-09T21:01:48","date_gmt":"2020-05-10T01:01:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7116"},"modified":"2020-06-21T18:45:58","modified_gmt":"2020-06-21T22:45:58","slug":"day-43-of-isolation-for-full-time-rvers","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/05\/09\/day-43-of-isolation-for-full-time-rvers\/","title":{"rendered":"Day 43 of Isolation for Full Time RV&#8217;ers"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>It&#8217;s another day living with the Covid-19 Corona virus issue and we&#8217;re dealing with it although missing our previously taken-for-granted freedoms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But we&#8217;re finding that working to stay as safe as we reasonably can, it&#8217;s not as bad as it first sounded a couple months ago.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As of early May Ohio is now starting to &#8220;open up&#8221; as Governor Mike Dewine has modified his previous &#8220;Stay At Home&#8221; order to &#8220;Stay Safe Ohio&#8221; still encouraging all of us to maintain social distancing and to use face coverings whenever we are out in public.  Kathy and I plan on continuing to basically shelter in place and only travel out for the necessary and always take the appropriate precautions.  Our hope is that we will all be able to get out more freely by the end of summer &#8211; but that remains to be seen.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We consider ourselves fortunate that we have a place to stay safe that allows us to still have the freedom to go outside and enjoy our surroundings.  There are so many others that live in a small apartment or condo and really have nowhere to go out and stretch a bit.  If we had stayed at our RV park in Arizona &#8211; or any other park for that matter, we would be confined to our motorhome or our patio area.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As it is, we are &#8220;parked&#8221; in the Bunkhouse above the garage at the home of our daughter Sara and husband Stu.  We sold them our home when we hit the road in 2016.  We had finished off the storage room on top of the garage making it into a small apartment a few years ago as a guest room since the main house was an open floor plan with just one bedroom.  Little did we know at the time that WE might end up being the guests!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7121\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103650-685x324.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The &#8220;Indian Mound Lodge&#8221; &#8211; our previous home built in the early &#8217;60&#8217;s sits on 6+ acres of woods<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7122\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_110726-685x324.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Inside the lodge looking through the kitchen into the living room<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>During the time the governors stay at home order was in place, we only made a trip to the grocery about once a week &#8230; and I have to admit that I also made a few trips to Menards or Lowes to get supplies for the projects I&#8217;ve been working on here at the bunkhouse.  I&#8217;ve always kept my distance from other shoppers and used the mask during my visit and hand sanitizer when I got back in the car.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7130\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_103628-685x324.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The Bunkhouse above the garage.  The big silver tarp covers Sara&#8217;s therapy pool<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The projects around the house here have been my savior &#8211; they&#8217;ve allowed me to keep from going crazy with boredom.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"208\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532.jpg?fit=685%2C187&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7118\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532-300x82.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532-1024x280.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532-768x210.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532-1536x420.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/PANO_20200506_112532-685x187.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The &#8220;Bunkhouse&#8221; apartment above the garage (panoramic image)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;ve done some painting (yellow) of a couple walls in the living area along with the bathroom and spent considerable time (I&#8217;m not a carpenter) installing new kitchen cupboards\/counter top\/sink and shelving for the kitchenette.  And of course hung some things on the walls to make it feel a little more &#8220;homey&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7119\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_112347-685x324.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The newly completed kitchenette awaits the arrival of an electric range<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And Kathy has been wonderful at keeping busy helping Sara with spring cleaning of the house and they also worked together helping a friend of Sara&#8217;s to make masks for others.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7117\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_140852-685x385.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Sara and Kathy working on cutting material for masks in the porch<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignleft size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"315\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/SaraDriving2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7124\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/SaraDriving2.jpg 315w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/SaraDriving2-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/SaraDriving2-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/SaraDriving2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 315px) 100vw, 315px\" \/><figcaption>Sara at work<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Sara just went back to work yesterday.  She had taken a layoff from her job driving a mini-bus for the local county transportation service.  Once the stay at home order was in place the bus runs to doctors appointments and shopping trips dropped off drastically and so the bus service reduced their driver pool from 18 drivers down to only five.  But that&#8217;s ok &#8211; it gave Sara the long awaited opportunity to spend time outside working on the beds planting and transplanting .. something she really enjoys doing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In addition to working on the bunkhouse, I had asked Stu to make a list of things I could be doing while he is at work.  Stu works in Physical Therapy at a nearby nursing\/rehab facility.  He came up with a list (on a yellow legal pad) of about 15+ items!  Since it&#8217;s early spring a lot of what I\/we have been up to has been outside as long as the weather is above 40 degrees or so.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7126\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200412_111425-685x385.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Kathy, Sara and I trimming, collecting and burning brush<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7127\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200403_154707-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Bringing another load of firewood to the splitter<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Our son David, his wife Lisa and son Garret live just about a mile down the road.  David works from home and hasn&#8217;t had to do any traveling since this whole thing started.  They&#8217;ve dealt with the stay-at-home order fine as they live on 8+ acres, have a few animals to take care of and Lisa always keeps a very well stocked pantry and freezer so they&#8217;ve not had to go out hardly at all.  Garret doing his 6th grade school work at home via computer.  He&#8217;s also been working on some life skill lessons.  Papa worked with him on making some Squirrel Picnic Tables that he&#8217;s selling on Facebook and he&#8217;ll be working with David and me next week learning how to wire lights and switches in their barn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7128\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200422_155054-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption>Garret at the radial arm saw cutting material for the squirrel picnic tables<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The other day I decided to show Sara that I trust her explicitly and allowed her to cut my &#8220;hair&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103.jpg?fit=576%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7131\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103.jpg 304w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103-768x1365.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103-864x1536.jpg 864w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200409_154103-685x1218.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 304px) 100vw, 304px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Although we miss the opportunity to eat out at some of our favorite restaurants, we&#8217;re also learning some new recipes and enjoying dinners together with Stu and Sara.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7132\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/IMG_20200506_175342-685x324.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Jumbo pasta shells stuffed with Ricotta\/Mozzarella cheese and spinach &#8211; Yummy!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Tomorrow is Mother&#8217;s Day &#8211; I know it&#8217;ll be another great day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Stay safe.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>It&#8217;s another day living with the Covid-19 Corona virus issue and we&#8217;re dealing with it although missing our previously taken-for-granted freedoms. But we&#8217;re finding that working to stay as safe as we reasonably can, it&#8217;s not as bad as it first sounded a couple months ago. As of early May Ohio is now starting to &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/05\/09\/day-43-of-isolation-for-full-time-rvers\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Day 43 of Isolation for Full Time RV&#8217;ers<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7134,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,586,6185234],"tags":[554707882,554707872,554707894,554707713,554707892,554707891,554707893,554707873],"class_list":["post-7116","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-family","category-food","category-morrow-county","tag-bunkhouse","tag-corona","tag-covid-19-2","tag-kitchen","tag-mask","tag-safe","tag-stay-home","tag-virus"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7116","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7116"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7116\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7182,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7116\/revisions\/7182"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7134"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7116"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7116"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7116"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}